Short:    FAME BBS-System V1.23 Demo Version.
Uploader: strider@trsi.de (David Wettig)
Author:   strider@trsi.de (David Wettig)
Type:     comm/bbs

FAME is a brand new Multi-Node BBS-System, which is currently under
development. It supports the following main features:

 - Amiga style-guide conform programming and GUI
 - Configuration via one config program, no usage of icons or scripts
 - Runs as commodity, uses Kickstart V2.0+ functions only
 - No limitations on conferences, nodes or other BBS-related things
   (Demo-version has an userlimit of 10 users and cannot be loaded resident)
 - Supports Hydra & the XPR standard
 - Configurable background file checking and posting
 - Own DoorPort with over 380 public commands
 - Full documentation and programmer examples in ASM & C included (SAS/C &
   StormC, AsmOne & Devpac compatible)
 - Installation via Installer script; easy and fast installation
 - Many tools and doors included (FAMEFullEd,FAMEChat,etc.)

And many many more, see supplied documentation for a complete list of
features this BBS distinguishes.
